hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1036","[AI-translation] Ubada bin Samit (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par jab wahi utarti to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko sakhti maloom hoti aur chehra mubarak par mitti ka rang aa jata. Kehtay hain ke aik din Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par wahi utri aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko aisi hi sakhti maloom hui. Jab wahi mauqoof ho gayi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke mujh se seekh lo Allah Taala ne auraton ke liye rasta kar diya. Agar shaadi shuda, shaadi shuda se zina karay aur ghair shaadi shuda, ghair shaadi shuda se zina karay to shaadi shuda ko sau, 100, koray laga kar sangsaar kar dein aur ghair shaadi shuda ko sau, 100, koray laga kar aik saal tak watan se bahar nikaal dein. (Muslim: 5/115). Baab: Shaadi shuda ka zina mein rajm. (Chehra mutaghayyir honay se murad wahi ki sakhti hai.)"
"1037","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utba se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se suna wo kehtay thay ke Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke mimbar par baith kar farmaya ke Allah ne Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko haq ke saath bheja aur un par kitab utari, usi kitab mein rajm ki aayat bhi thi, yani aayat: Budha mard aur budhi aurat jab zina karein to unhein zaroor sangsaar karo, lekin us ki tilawat mauqoof ho gayi aur hukm baaqi hai. Ham ne us aayat ko padha aur yaad rakha aur samjha. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne bhi rajm kiya aur ham ne bhi Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baad rajm kiya. Main darta hun ke jab zyada muddat guzray gi to koi ye na kehnay lag ke hamein Allah Taala ki kitab mein rajm nahi milta. Phir gumrah ho jaye us farz ko chhor kar jis ko Allah Taala ne utara. Beshak Allah Taala ki kitab mein us shakhs par jo shaadi shuda ho kar zina karay mard ho ya aurat rajm haq hai. Aur ye us soorat mein hi hai ke jab gawah qaim hon zina par ya hamal ho ya zani khud iqraar karay. Rajm, aadha zameen mein gaar kar upar se pathar maar maar kar khatm kar denay ko kehtay hain. (Muslim: 5/116). Baab: Jo apne aap par zina ka iqraar karay us ki had. (Umar ke khadshay ke mutabiq Khawarij aur Mutazila ne rajm ka inkar kiya.)"
"1038","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas chotay qad ka aadmi jis ke baal paraganda aur jism mazboot tha, us par chaadar thi aur us ne zina kiya tha, laya gaya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne do baar us ki baat ko taala phir hukm kiya to wo sangsaar kiya gaya. Us ke baad Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jab ham Allah ki raah mein jihad ke liye nikaltay hain to tum mein se koi na koi peechay reh jata hai aur bakray ki tarah aawaz karta hai aur kisi aurat ko thora doodh deta hai. Beshak Allah Taala mere qaabu mein aisay shakhs ko de ga to main us ko aisi sakht saza dun ga jo doosron ke liye nasihat ho. Rawi ne kaha ke main ne ye hadees Sa'id bin Jubair (raziyallahu anhu) se bayan ki to unhon ne kaha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chaar baar us ki baat ko taala. Aur aik riwayat mein do dafa ya teen dafa ka zikr hai. (Muslim: 5/117). (Kusba se murad thora doodh hai; ye riwayat Shuba ki hai jo Samak bin Harb se hai.)"
"1039","[AI-translation] Buraida (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Maiz bin Malik Aslami (raziyallahu anhu) Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main ne apni jaan par zulm kiya hai ke zina kar baitha hun. Main chahta hun ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mujhe paak karein. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ko pher diya. Phir jab doosra din hua to wo phir aaye aur kehnay lagay ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main ne zina kiya hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ko pher diya aur un ki qaum ke paas kisi ko bheja aur daryaft karaya ke un ki aqal mein kuch fatoor hai? Aur tum ne koi baat dekhi? Unhon ne kaha ke ham to kuch fatoor nahi jantay aur jahan tak ham samajhtay hain un ki aqal achi hai. Phir teesri baar Maiz (raziyallahu anhu) aaye to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ki qaum ke paas phir bheja aur yehi daryaft karaya to unhon ne kaha ke un ko koi beemari nahi hai aur na un ki aqal mein kuch fatoor hai. Jab wo chauthi baar aaye aur unhon ne yehi kaha ke main ne zina kiya hai mujhe paak kijiye halanke tauba se bhi paaki ho sakti thi magar Maiz (raziyallahu anhu) ko shak hua ke shayad tauba qabool na ho, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ke liye aik garha khudwaya phir wo Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hukm par rajm kiye gaye. Rawi kehta hai us ke baad Ghamidiya ki aurat aayi aur kehnay lagi Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main ne zina kiya hai mujhe paak kijiye. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ko pher diya. Jab doosra din hua to us ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mujhe kyun lautatay hain? Shayad Aap aisay lautana chahtay hain jaisay Maiz (raziyallahu anhu) ko lautaya tha. Allah ki qasam main to hamila hun, to ab zina mein kya shak hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke acha agar tu nahi laut-ti aur tauba kar ke paak hona nahi chahti balke duniya ki saza hi chahti hai to ja, jannay ke baad aana. Jab wiladat ho gayi to bacha ko aik kapray mein lapait kar laayi aur kaha: Lijiye ye bacha paida ho gaya hai. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ja us ko doodh pila jab us ka doodh chhutay. Jab us ka doodh chhuta to wo bacha ko laayi jis ke haath mein roti ka tukra tha aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Ye dekhiye doodh chhura diya hai aur khana khanay laga hai. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne bacha aik Musalman mard ko de diya phir us ka hukm diya to us ke seenay tak garha khoda gaya aur logon ko hukm diya to unhon ne usay sangsaar kiya. To Khalid bin Waleed pathar le kar aagay badhay aur us ka sar maara to khoon Khalid ke chehray par chheent pada to unhon ne usay bura kaha. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ka usay bura kehna suna to farmaya: Tehro Ae Khalid! Qasam us ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai beshak us ne aisi tauba ki hai ke agar mehsol lenay wala aisi tauba karay to usay bakhsh diya jaye. Phir Aap ne us ka hukm diya to us par namaz padhi aur wo dafan ki gayi. (Muslim: 5/120). Baab: Zimmi Yahud ka zina mein rajm. (Garha khodnay ka zikr shaaz hai, Siqa rawi Alqama ne us ka zikr nahi kiya; imma la se murad hai ke agar tu pardah nahi chahti.)"
"1040","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aik Yahudi mard aur aik Yahudi aurat ko laya gaya jinhon ne zina kiya tha. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Yahud ke paas tashreef le gaye aur poocha ke Tauraat mein zina ki kya saza hai? Unhon ne kaha ham donon ka munh kala kar ke gadon par is tarah sawaar kartay hain ke un ka munh gadon ki dum ki taraf hota hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya acha to agar tum sach kehtay ho, Tauraat lao. Wo le kar aaye aur padhnay lagay, jab rajm ki aayat aayi to jo shakhs padh raha tha us ne apna haath us aayat par rakh diya aur aagay aur peechay ka mazmoon padh diya. Abdullah bin Salam (raziyallahu anhu), Yahud ke aalim jo Musalman ho gaye thay, wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath thay, unhon ne kaha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us shakhs se kahiye ke apna haath uthaye. Us ne haath uthaya to rajm ki aayat haath ke neechay thi. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hukm se wo donon rajm kiye gaye. Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke main un logon mein se tha jinhon ne un ko rajm kiya main ne dekha ke mard apni aar se aurat ko patharon se bacha raha tha, yani pathar apne upar leta mohabbat se. (Muslim: 5/122). Baab: Londi jab zina karay to usay koray maarna. (Unhein gadon par sawaar kiya jata, munh dum ki taraf.)"
"1041","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha gaya ke londi jo shaadi shuda nahi hai, wo zina karay to kya saza ho gi? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke us ko koray lagao, phir zina karay to phir koray lagao. Phir zina karay to phir koray lagao. Phir us ko baich daalo agarchay aik rassi qeemat ki aaye. Ibn Shihab ko shak hai ke baichnay ka hukm teesri baar ke baad diya, ya chauthi baar ke baad. (Muslim)"
"1042","[AI-translation] Abu Abdur Rahman (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne khutba padha to kaha ke Ae logon! Apni londi, ghulamon ko had lagao khwah wo shaadi shuda hon ya na hon, yani koray maaro. Kyunke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki aik londi ne zina kiya, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh ko usay koray laganay ka hukm diya. Dekha to us ke han abhi qareeb hi wiladat hui thi. Main dara ke kahin us ko koray maarun to wo mar hi na jaye. Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bayan kiya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tu ne acha kiya jo koray lagana mauqoof rakha. Aik riwayat mein itna zyada hai ke main us ko us waqt tak chhoro jab tak wo achi ho jaye, yani nifaas se saaf ho. Yehi hukm hai mareeza ka. Us ko bhi had nahi maarein ge jab tak ke tandrust na ho jaye. (Muslim: 5/125)"
